==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|слу́шать|-ся}}, from {{der|ru|ine-pro|*ḱlew-}}, whence {{cog|en|listen}} and possibly {{m|en|slave}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|слу́шаться}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-слушаться.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|слу́шаться|impf|pf=послу́шаться}}

# to [[obey]], to [[take]] (someone's) [[advice]], to [[listen]] to
#: {{uxi|ru|'''слу́шаться''' [[роди́телей]]|'''to obey''' one's parents}}
# {{lb|ru|imperfective only}} to [[obey]], to be [[under]] [[control]] {{q|of a mechanism or body part}}
# {{infl of|ru|слу́шать||pass}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|impf|1a|слу́шаться}}
